603 0 obj
  << /ActualText ( at the historic Fort Mason Center in San Francisco\054 California\054\240on October 28\02329\056\240\nGitHub Universe is GitHub\031s flagship event that brings together the experts\054 leaders\054 and builders shaping the future of software\056\240It\031s\240known for keynotes\054 sessions\054 workshops\054 and immersive product experiences that focus on practical\054 real\055world approaches to building and shipping software\056\240\240\nThis year\031s programming is designed to\240help\240teams\240operate\240effectively in the agentic era\054 where developers work alongside agents\054 streamline workflows\054 and move faster without losing the human side of software\056\240\nAttending in person would give me the opportunity to learn directly from GitHub teams and industry peers\054 build relationships across the ecosystem\054 and bring back best practices to\240benefit\240our broader team\056\240\240\nHere\031s an approximate breakout of conference costs\072\nConference pass\072 \133insert current pass price \057 \034Super Early\050Bird rate\035\135\nAirfare\072 \133ADD COST\135\nRound trip transportation between airport and hotel\072 \133ADD COST\135\nHotel\072 \133add cost per night\135 \050plus taxes\054 subject to availability\051\240\nMeals\072 Breakfast\054 lunch\054 coffee\054 and snacks are provided at Universe\nTotal\072 \133ADD COST\135\nIf we purchase four or more passes\054 we\031ll receive 20\045 off with team pricing\054 which would reduce costs if others from our team are also interested in attending\056\nIn an industry that is constantly evolving\054 I believe attending GitHub Universe will help keep\240\133Company\135\240on the cusp of\240what\031s\240new\054\240so we can innovate better and faster\054 learn from proven examples\054 and apply those insights to our work\056\240\nThank you for considering my request\056 If approved\054\240I\031m\240happy to share a brief plan for what\240I\031ll\240focus on and a recap afterward with concrete takeaways and recommendations\056\240\n\240\240\nBest regards\054\240\n\133Your name\135\240\050\133Your title \057 team\135\240)
     /K [ 7 ]
     /P 604 0 R
     /Pg 591 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

